WEBVTT

00:10:57.569 --> 00:11:00.531
that you don't embarrass yourself
and become a meme.

00:11:00.531 --> 00:11:01.699
(Laughter)

00:11:01.740 --> 00:11:03.784
Understanding ethical theories

00:11:03.784 --> 00:11:09.415
is how we increase our chances of success
at simply being human beings

00:11:09.415 --> 00:11:12.835
who have to negotiate
with other human beings.

00:11:12.876 --> 00:11:16.797
And to me, there is nothing
more important than that.

00:11:17.506 --> 00:11:18.674
Thank you.

00:11:18.674 --> 00:11:25.431
(Applause)